<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:10:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“我们将开始变得更像欧洲”：千禧一代30多岁都在家生活，这标志着重大转变</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/america-start-looking-a-lot-more-like-europe-millennials-living-at-home-into-30s-signaling-shift/</link><description>一位房地产专家告诉《财富》杂志，美国生活正在发生“长期转变”：越来越多的年轻人“满足”与父母一起住在家里。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2256734331-e1790693793894.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:16:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/america-start-looking-a-lot-more-like-europe-millennials-living-at-home-into-30s-signaling-shift/</guid></item><item><title>联邦调查局正在调查一张可能与南希·格思里失踪有关的新勒索信</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/nancy-guthrie-kidnapping-ransom-note/</link><description>《今日》主持人萨凡纳·格思里的母亲二月份在亚利桑那州的家中失踪，目前尚未逮捕任何嫌疑人&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26272203933485-e1790699213909.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:39:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/nancy-guthrie-kidnapping-ransom-note/</guid></item><item><title>婴儿潮一代正在与千禧一代摊牌，就地养老并投入数十万翻修房屋</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/baby-boomers-millennials-mortgage-rates-aging-in-place-renovations/</link><description>千禧一代需要房屋，但由于房价和抵押贷款利率高企，婴儿潮一代没有理由出售房屋。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/GettyImages-2174889879-e1741379829956.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:16:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/baby-boomers-millennials-mortgage-rates-aging-in-place-renovations/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 2万亿美元的IPO招股说明书已泄露——这是其损益表的快照</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/anthropic-ipo-s-1-prospectus-income-statement/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294938529-e1790676106462.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:03:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/anthropic-ipo-s-1-prospectus-income-statement/</guid></item><item><title>这个人研究了金融体系“真正跳动的心脏”，并看到了一些“极其危险”的东西</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/robin-wigglesworth-interview-a-fabulous-debt-bond-market-history/</link><description>指数基金历史书《万亿》（Trillions）一书的作者罗宾·威格尔斯沃斯（Robin Wigglesworth）在《神话般的债务》（A Fabulous Debt）中带着对债券的千年回顾回来了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2203546.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/robin-wigglesworth-interview-a-fabulous-debt-bond-market-history/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌数据中心负责人表示，美国各地有“数十万”的技术贸易职位空缺，而且“只是等待填补”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/skilled-trades-job-openings-by-the-hundreds-of-thousands-plumbers-electricans-gen-z-six-figure-careers-data-center-investment-google/</link><description>尽管人们对数据中心的反对日益强烈，但数万亿美元的人工智能投资正在推动美国高薪技术行业工作岗位的激增&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2271143503-e1790693143136.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:41:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/skilled-trades-job-openings-by-the-hundreds-of-thousands-plumbers-electricans-gen-z-six-figure-careers-data-center-investment-google/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国人在家里花更多的钱以避免外出，乐趣膨胀正在助长兴趣爱好</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/funflation-hobbies-americans-spending-more-at-home-travel-airfare-gas-restaurant-prices-rise/</link><description>机票、外出就餐和汽油价格的上涨使得美国人对支出更加挑剔。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287765066-e1790694667676.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:30:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/funflation-hobbies-americans-spending-more-at-home-travel-airfare-gas-restaurant-prices-rise/</guid></item><item><title>“战争将这样结束”：伊朗指责美国试图将伊朗“重新变成殖民地”，其货币跌至历史新低</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/iran-currency-new-low-us-back-into-colony/</link><description>最近一次下跌是在9月2日里亚尔兑美元创下历史新低220万之后仅27天。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26272315478816-e1790692490570.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:17:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/iran-currency-new-low-us-back-into-colony/</guid></item><item><title>“我们需要致力于耐心对话”：教皇利奥警告当今战争中的“统治欲望”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/pope-leo-desire-for-domination-war/</link><description>教皇利奥结束了对法国的访问，回顾了为非洲大陆和平一体化做出贡献的力量。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2213409508-e1790693486707.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:17:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/pope-leo-desire-for-domination-war/</guid></item><item><title>量子不会杀死加密货币，但它可以加速华尔街对区块链的采用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/chris-perkins-op-ed/</link><description>富兰克林邓普顿加密货币高管表示，加密货币行业多年来一直在为“Q-Day”做准备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287693009.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/chris-perkins-op-ed/</guid></item></channel></rss>